{"candidateAnswer":"Use his platform to help others through mentorship and community work","evidence":"[D11:19 | 8:17 pm on 21 September, 2023] John: I've thought about it a lot. I want to use my platform to make a positive difference and inspire others - maybe even start a foundation and do charity work. It's important to me to make the most of the chances I get and leave a meaningful legacy.","itemId":"urn:uuid:8e40b339-9a27-51c1-a144-dd0a428d4512","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:03f4ad3ffaa7d841701d84a4cdeb25d7bc3e5a8f6bf2da0b7bb5fdf8e91144b5","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What does John want to do after his basketball career?","referenceAnswer":"positively influence and inspire others, potentially start a foundation and engage in charity work","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"03f4ad3ffaa7d841701d84a4cdeb25d7bc3e5a8f6bf2da0b7bb5fdf8e91144b5"}}]}